</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135919385,imgsize-33614.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Apologies should come from heart': SC pulls up Sanjay Raut over remarks against CJI]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/apologies-should-come-from-heart-sc-pulls-up-sanjay-raut-over-remarks-against-cji/articleshow/135919011.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135919011.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/apologies-should-come-from-heart-sc-pulls-up-sanjay-raut-over-remarks-against-cji/articleshow/135919011.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/apologies-should-come-from-heart-sc-pulls-up-sanjay-raut-over-remarks-against-cji/articleshow/135919011.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-17T15:01:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vivek Dubey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135919153,imgsize-49570.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['We don't have data based on religion': UP CEO on claim 'Hindu voters' were deleted in SIR]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/we-dont-have-data-based-on-religion-up-ceo-on-yogi-adityanaths-claim-that-1-27-cr-hindu-voters-were-deleted-in-sir/articleshow/135918905.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135918905.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/we-dont-have-data-based-on-religion-up-ceo-on-yogi-adityanaths-claim-that-1-27-cr-hindu-voters-were-deleted-in-sir/articleshow/135918905.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/we-dont-have-data-based-on-religion-up-ceo-on-yogi-adityanaths-claim-that-1-27-cr-hindu-voters-were-deleted-in-sir/articleshow/135918905.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-17T14:57:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135918980,imgsize-669711.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Cyclone Akvan: IMD warns of extremely heavy rainfall, 145 kmph winds along Andhra coast]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cyclone-akvan-imd-warns-of-extremely-heavy-rainfall-145-kmph-winds-along-andhra-coast/articleshow/135916770.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135916770.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Cyclonic Storm Akvan is brewing over the Bay of Bengal and is set to escalate rapidly. The India Meteorological Department warns that by November 19, the storm will reach a very severe level. Landfall is forecasted for November 20, targeting Andhra Pradesh, with heavy rains expected across nearby states like Tamil Nadu and Odisha. Residents are urged to brace for powerful winds and potential flooding along the coast.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cyclone-akvan-imd-warns-of-extremely-heavy-rainfall-145-kmph-winds-along-andhra-coast/articleshow/135916770.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cyclone-akvan-imd-warns-of-extremely-heavy-rainfall-145-kmph-winds-along-andhra-coast/articleshow/135916770.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-17T13:41:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Mahima Sharma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135916946,imgsize-95640.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Criminal contempt’: Calcutta High Court issues show-cause notice to Abhishek Banerjee over remarks against court]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/criminal-contempt-calcutta-high-court-issues-show-cause-notice-to-abhishek-banerjee-over-remarks-against-court/articleshow/135916160.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135916160.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Calcutta High Court has issued a show-cause notice to Trinamool Congress MP Abhishek Banerjee for contempt of court. The court found that Banerjee's statements potentially interfere with justice and ordered him to respond within 15 days. Additionally, the High Court has directed a review of Banerjee's security arrangements amid ongoing legal issues. Banerjee has previously appeared before Kolkata Police in relation to another case regarding his remarks about the police.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/criminal-contempt-calcutta-high-court-issues-show-cause-notice-to-abhishek-banerjee-over-remarks-against-court/articleshow/135916160.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/criminal-contempt-calcutta-high-court-issues-show-cause-notice-to-abhishek-banerjee-over-remarks-against-court/articleshow/135916160.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-17T13:32:02+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135916603,imgsize-105416.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Watch: Prince William, Kate Middleton ride electric three-wheeler at Mumbai Earthshot event]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/watch-prince-william-kate-middleton-ride-electric-three-wheeler-at-mumbai-earthshot-event/articleshow/135914365.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135914365.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Prince William and Kate Middleton visited Bandra Reclamation Garden in Mumbai to engage with environmental finalists. They traveled in an electric three-wheeler and interacted with 15 innovative finalists from around the world. The event focused on environmental solutions and preceded the Earthshot Prize awards ceremony, which India is hosting for the first time. Prince William emphasized India's role in addressing environmental challenges and economic growth.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/watch-prince-william-kate-middleton-ride-electric-three-wheeler-at-mumbai-earthshot-event/articleshow/135914365.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/watch-prince-william-kate-middleton-ride-electric-three-wheeler-at-mumbai-earthshot-event/articleshow/135914365.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-17T12:45:22+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135914709,imgsize-1176430.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[No froth along 52-km stretch of Yamuna in Delhi: Water minister Parvesh Sahib Singh]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-froth-along-52-km-stretch-of-yamuna-in-delhi-water-minister-parvesh-sahib-singh/articleshow/135914741.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135914741.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Delhi's water minster Parvesh Sahib Singh stated that froth was not present in the Yamuna during Chhath Puja celebrations. He dismissed accusations from the Aam Aadmi Party regarding the river's condition. Discussions are ongoing with Uttar Pradesh to manage issues near the Okhla Barrage. The Central Pollution Control Board highlights foaming agents in wastewater as the main cause of froth. A study links poor water quality to the froth formation in the river.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-froth-along-52-km-stretch-of-yamuna-in-delhi-water-minister-parvesh-sahib-singh/articleshow/135914741.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-froth-along-52-km-stretch-of-yamuna-in-delhi-water-minister-parvesh-sahib-singh/articleshow/135914741.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-17T12:39:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135915041,imgsize-115656.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['I am scared once again': Bilkis Bano releases statement after SC grants bail to two convicts]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/i-am-scared-once-again-bilkis-bano-releases-statement-after-sc-grants-bail-to-two-convicts/articleshow/135914851.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135914851.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/i-am-scared-once-again-bilkis-bano-releases-statement-after-sc-grants-bail-to-two-convicts/articleshow/135914851.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/i-am-scared-once-again-bilkis-bano-releases-statement-after-sc-grants-bail-to-two-convicts/articleshow/135914851.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-17T12:38:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vivek Dubey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135915058,imgsize-87024.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['You don't deserve to sit in that chair': SC to hear SCBA plea against lawyer over remarks against CJI]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/you-dont-deserve-to-sit-in-that-chair-sc-to-hear-scba-plea-against-lawyer-over-remarks-against-cji/articleshow/135914378.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135914378.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The Supreme Court is set to hear a contempt plea filed by the Supreme Court Bar Association. The plea concerns a lawyer's disrespectful remarks towards the Chief Justice during court proceedings. Members of the Bar reported the incident after the lawyer questioned the Chief Justice's authority and integrity. The lawyer had made an unscheduled mention of a petition that remained unlisted.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/you-dont-deserve-to-sit-in-that-chair-sc-to-hear-scba-plea-against-lawyer-over-remarks-against-cji/articleshow/135914378.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/you-dont-deserve-to-sit-in-that-chair-sc-to-hear-scba-plea-against-lawyer-over-remarks-against-cji/articleshow/135914378.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-17T12:24:42+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135914378,imgsize-74532.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Taking us for a ride': HC pulls up Kejriwal, AAP leaders over posts against Delhi judge with a warning]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/taking-us-for-a-ride-hc-pulls-up-kejriwal-aap-leaders-over-posts-against-delhi-judge-with-a-warning/articleshow/135914260.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135914260.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/taking-us-for-a-ride-hc-pulls-up-kejriwal-aap-leaders-over-posts-against-delhi-judge-with-a-warni